{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "version": "1.5.0",
  "name": "星塔旅人攻略查询",
  "description": "星塔旅人（Stella Sora）攻略与排行榜插件：QQ 群中文提问返回 GameKee 星塔旅人 wiki 「一图流攻略」原图（星塔攻略组授权转载，覆盖六大属性 24 个角色小节）；/st_bb・/st_fe 渲染当期联合讨伐/终焉绝响国服 Top100 图片榜单（名次不补零、分数完整对齐）；/st_update 强刷两榜并探查攻略源更新。数据源：GameKee + ssleaderboard。",
  "author": {
    "name": "ggsfly",
    "url": "https://github.com/ggsfly"
  },
  "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/ggsfly/stellasora-plugin",
    "homepage": "https://stelladb.pages.dev/",
    "documentation": "https://github.com/ggsfly/stellasora-plugin#readme",
    "issues": "https://github.com/ggsfly/stellasora-plugin/issues"
  },
  "changelog": "CHANGELOG.md",
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.3.15",
    "max_version": "1.99.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.16.0",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "plugin_type": "tool",
  "display": {
    "icon": {
      "type": "lucide",
      "value": "compass"
    }
  },
  "capabilities": [
    "send.text",
    "send.forward",
    "render.html2png",
    "chat.get_all_streams"
  ],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN",
    "supported_locales": [
      "zh-CN"
    ]
  },
  "id": "ggsfly.stellasora-plugin"
}
